#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:1
msgid "STEFG Young Eagle Plan"
msgstr "天使基金雏鹰计划"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:4
msgid "Loan | Citywide / global"
msgstr "贷款｜全市／全球"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:6
msgid "Program published; eligibility review"
msgstr "项目已公布，须资格审核"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:8
msgid "`Evidence S043 <https://fund.stefg.org/Angel/Intro.aspx>`_. 创业基金会."
msgstr "`证据 S043 <https://fund.stefg.org/Angel/Intro.aspx>`_. 创业基金会."

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:13
msgid ""
"Up to RMB 500,000; interest-free; 3 years; equal principal over 36 months"
msgstr "最高50万元，免息，资助期3年，36个月等额本金偿还"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:15
msgid "No equity; repayable"
msgstr "不占股，须偿还"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:20
msgid ""
"Chinese nationals aged at most 40 who meet the student/graduate rules; "
"founder is the largest natural-person shareholder and legal "
"representative; full-time startup; Shanghai company registered at most 3 "
"years."
msgstr "符合在读或毕业生条件、40周岁及以下的中国籍创业者；须为自然人大股东与法定代表人，全职创业，上海企业成立不超过3年。"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:22
msgid "Confirm branch intake and review schedule"
msgstr "确认受理分会及评审安排"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route "
"<https://fund.stefg.org/Angel/Intro.aspx>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://fund.stefg.org/Angel/Intro.aspx>`_"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:29
msgid "Published consultation: +86 21 55231818."
msgstr "公布咨询电话：+86 21 55231818。"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the foundation's current eligibility rules and choose loan or "
"temporary equity."
msgstr "阅读基金会现行资格，选择贷款或临时股权。"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:35
msgid ""
"Identify a receiving branch and submit the prescribed founder and project "
"documents."
msgstr "确认受理分会，提交规定创业者及项目材料。"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:37
msgid ""
"Complete review and examine repayment, founder funding and exit "
"obligations."
msgstr "完成评审，审核还款、自筹及退出义务。"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:39
msgid ""
"Sign the correct agreement and track the full three-year obligations."
msgstr "签署对应协议，跟踪完整三年义务。"

#: ../../funding/stefg-loan.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
